  "description": "Ho-jun gets dumped by his lover yet again, all because he’s a \"quirky tiger who wants to be held.\"\n\nWhile drowning his sorrows at his usual bar, completely drunk and bemoaning his fate, he catches the eye of Sahyeon, who happens to walk in at that very moment.\n\nIntrigued by Ho-jun—ears and tail on full display, sniffling as he wallows in self-pity—Sahyeon naturally slips into the seat next to him.\n\n_Source: [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/bad_snake/1), translated_\n\n**Official Links:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/bad_snake)",
